starfighter/native/

# 3D models and large media - NOT in git.
# .glb is already-compressed binary, so git cannot delta it: every re-export
# stored another full copy. AlienMotherShip.glb sat in the history four times
# at 82, 66, 54 and 31 MB. That is why the repo reached 1.2 GB.
# These are deployed by scripts/push-assets.sh instead. See that file.
*.glb
*.gltf
*.fbx
*.obj
*.blend
*.blend1
*.mp4
*.mov
starfighter/assets/models/zorgonWarrior
